  description: Same air as practical-136km, thinner column. Air mass 12.1 rather than 5.2, so the slant path alone carries the sunset to Earth's horizon optical depth. The cost is framing - the camera must sit lower to stay inside the air, so less ground is visible, and mountains stand clear of the haze.
